        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Ives CL14, Commercial Auxiliary Push for CL12 Cabinet Latch</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis is an Auxiliary Pusher to aid in the operation of the <a href=\"/products/invisible-latch-ives-cl12\">Ives CL12 Invisible Latch</a> where hinges or surrounding conditions prevent smooth operation of doors or for heavy doors. The Auxiliary Pusher for Cabinet Latches applies 10 pounds to open the door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Ives CL14 Auxiliary Push Cabinet Latch:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass with a nylon pusher.</li>\r\n<li>Length: 2-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Throw: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Applies 10 pounds to open the door.</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Chrome</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>",
